=\"sidebar\"><a class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"TINAN AI home\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">T</span><span class=\"brand-copy\"><strong>TINAN</strong><small>Natural Intelligence</small></span></a><div class=\"workspace-label\">WORKSPACE</div><nav class=\"primary-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><button class=\"nav-item selected\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌂</span>Dashboard<span class=\"nav-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"nav-item \" type=\"button\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✳</span>AI workspace</button></nav><div class=\"workspace-label tools-label\">MORE TO EXPLORE</div><nav class=\"primary-nav\" aria-label=\"Planned features\"><a class=\"nav-item planned-item\" href=\"/projects\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Project Builder<span class=\"planned-label\">BETA</span></a><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Tokenize is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Tokenize<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Wallet is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Wallet<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Tokens is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Tokens<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Contracts is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Contracts<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Deploy is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Deploy<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Verify is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Verify<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Community is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Community<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Docs is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Docs<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button><button class=\"nav-item planned-item\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Settings is planned, not available yet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span>Settings<span class=\"planned-label\">PLANNED</span></button></nav><div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><div class=\"demo-indicator\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Demo provider active</div><p>Simulated planning only.<br/>No external AI provider connected.</p><div class=\"profile-row\"><span class=\"avatar\">E</span><span><strong>Local workspace</strong><small>Development mode</small></span></div></div></aside><section class=\"main-column\"><header class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"breadcrumbs\"><span>Workspace</span><span class=\"crumb-divider\">/</span><strong>Overview</strong></div><div class=\"topbar-actions\"><span class=\"provider-pill\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Provider setup required</span><button class=\"help-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Help and documentation are planned\" disabled=\"\">?</button></div></header><div class=\"content-area\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-line\"></span>YOUR INTELLIGENCE WORKSPACE</div><h1>Good to see you.</h1><p>A thoughtful place to turn ideas into actionable plans.</p></div><div class=\"date-label\"><span class=\"live-pulse\"></span>AGENT WORKSPACE · PROCESS LOCAL</div></div><section class=\"stats-grid\" aria-label=\"Workspace activity\"><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-top\"><span>PLANS CREATED</span><span class=\"stat-icon\">≡</span></div><strong>00</strong><small>In this session</small></article><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-top\"><span>ACTIVE TASKS</span><span class=\"stat-icon\">◷</span></div><strong>00</strong><small>Planning, executing, or awaiting approval</small></article><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-top\"><span>CONNECTED PROVIDERS</span><span class=\"stat-icon\">⌘</span></div><strong>00</strong><small>Provider setup required</small></article></section><div class=\"workspace-grid\"><section class=\"chat-panel\" aria-label=\"Agent planning workspace\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><div class=\"agent-identity\"><span class=\"agent-orb\">✳</span><span><strong>TINAN Agent</strong><small><span class=\"status-dot\"></span> Ready to plan</small></span></div><div class=\"model-chip\"><span class=\"model-icon\">✧</span>Provider unavailable<!-- --> <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div></div><div class=\"conversation\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions\"><article class=\"message assistant\"><span class=\"message-avatar\">✳</span><div class=\"message-body\"><div class=\"message-meta\">TINAN<!-- --> <span>·</span> <!-- -->PROVIDER UNAVAILABLE</div><p>Tell me what you want to accomplish. When a server-side provider is configured, TINAN can request a model-generated plan and run only registered, permission-checked read/proposal tools. Otherwise, demo mode is explicit and simulated.</p></div></article></div><div class=\"suggestions\"><span>START WITH AN IDEA</span><div><button type=\"button\">Plan a landing page for my project<span>↗</span></button><button type=\"button\">Review the steps to test an ERC-20 contract<span>↗</span></button><button type=\"button\">Help me organize a new project<span>↗</span></button></div></div><form class=\"composer\"><label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"objective\">Describe what you want to accomplish</label><textarea id=\"objective\" maxLength=\"2000\" placeholder=\"Describe what you want to accomplish…\" rows=\"2\"></textarea><div class=\"composer-footer\"><span>Configure a server-side provider before planning.</span><button class=\"send-button\" disabled=\"\" type=\"submit\">Create plan<!-- --> <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</span></button></div></form></section><aside class=\"insights-column\"><section class=\"insight-card security-card\"><div class=\"card-heading\"><span class=\"card-icon shield-icon\">⬡</span><span>SAFE BY DESIGN</span><span class=\"info-mark\" title=\"Demo plans do not run tools or change files\">i</span></div><h2>Human approval<br/>comes first.</h2><p>Actions involving production, money, or destructive changes are flagged for explicit approval.</p><div class=\"security-rule\"><span class=\"rule-icon\">✓</span> No autonomous execution</div><div class=\"security-rule\"><span class=\"rule-icon\">✓</span> No keys or credentials stored</div></section><section class=\"insight-card recent-card\"><div class=\"recent-heading\"><h2>Recent plans</h2><span>00</span></div><div class=\"empty-recent\"><span class=\"empty-icon\">◌</span><p>Your plans will appear here.<br/>Create a plan to get started.</p></div><div class=\"history-note\"><span>↗</span> Process-local history · not durable</div></section></aside></div><footer class=\"page-footer\"><span>✳  Intelligence, with intention.</span><span>All plans require human review before action.</span></footer></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[6161,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-e25daf80c9bcadb0.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[4431,[],\\\"OutletBoundar